      "content": "Look, I get it. Security is important. But if I pull the plug now, the board is going to have my head over the lost revenue and the customer complaints. Are you 100% sure this is an immediate, \"stop-everything\" kind of vulnerability? Can we not just monitor it and patch it during the scheduled maintenance window next weekend instead?",
